  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A portal for information, dialogue and business advice to companies,  authorities and civil society regarding human rights and business.    Danish Institute for Human Rights are owner and implementer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En portal f&#xf6;r information, dialog och r&#xe5;dgivning till f&#xf6;retag,        myndigheter och civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer g&#xe4;llande m&#xe4;nskliga       r&#xe4;ttigheter och f&#xf6;retagande. Danska institutet f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga          r&#xe4;ttigheter &#xe4;r &#xe4;gare och genomf&#xf6;rare.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure access to a free and comprehensive web-base for allrelevant stakeholders to identify, assess and address human rights and business challenges in web-portal country contexts, as well as opportunities to facilitate business support for development.</narrative>
  </description>
